---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/what-they-sent-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/what-they-sent-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="A third of the pile linked LinkedIn where the work goes"
  caption="Counted across the 769 distinct applications."
>
  Bar chart out of 769 applications. 250 put a LinkedIn profile where the form asked for their work. 51 left the AI question blank. 33 linked no work at all.
</Chart>
